#. Descripción de «YAKUZA CARD» (woh_perk:26).
msgctxt "woh_perk:27"
msgid ""
"one additional slot becomes available in all shops\n"
"remove the [ILLICIT] tag from all items"
msgstr ""
"toutes les boutiques gagnent un emplacement supplémentaire\n"
"supprime la mention [ILLÉGAL] de tous les articles"

