#. Interfaz: menús, opciones y botones.
msgctxt "woh_ui:179"
msgid ""
"TIMELINE A\n"
"(WORLD OF HORROR)\n"
"Timeline choice determines changes in mysteries and their endings."
msgstr ""
"CHRONOLGIE A\n"
"(WORLD OF HORROR)\n"
"La chronologie détermine les variations des mystères et de leurs fins."

#. Interfaz: menús, opciones y botones.
msgctxt "woh_ui:180"
msgid ""
"TIMELINE B\n"
"(OCCULT CAPITAL OF JAPAN)\n"
"Every year, our city is visited by hundreds of tourists interested in the paranormal."
msgstr ""
"Chronologie B\n"
"(CAPITALE OCCULTE DU JAPON)\n"
"Chaque année, notre ville accueille des centaines de touristes passionnés par le paranormal."

#. Interfaz: menús, opciones y botones.
